prop jyrs zone.radius=1.8
prop jyrs zone.repeat=never
prop jyrs zone.message=The far slab. The gulls cannot reach you here - and neither could most collectors.
pop
# --- end of jump course rs ---

quest title=The Lowest Roofs
quest intro=The Rookery lives on the city's lowest roofs, and the Authority's butler bots guard its rations. Ines hid the ledger page here. Find the soup kitchen - and Maud Penn.
step reach|soup_kitchen|1|Find the Rookery's soup kitchen
step read|Rookery petition|1|Read the petition on the soup kitchen's board
step kill|Butler bot|3|Stop the three butler bots running wild round the hub and the trail foot
step collect|story:ration|3|Take the ration tins the bots were guarding
step read|Maud Penn's note|1|Read Maud Penn's note by the cold boiler in the south-east
step kill|Rat|4|Drive the four rats out of the barrels
step collect|story:watertoken|3|Find three water tokens in the empty barrels
step blueprint|Blueprint_TitaniumTools|1|Take the titanium tools' plans from the smithy hut
step reach|tollgate|1|Go out along the causeway to the tollgate
step kill|Screecher|3|Drive the three screechers off the roofs
step blueprint|Blueprint_BackpackAdvanced|1|Take the advanced backpack's plans from the packer's hut
step reach|gull_stacks|1|Climb the gull stacks north of the Rookery
step read|Pip's note|1|Read the note Pip left on the gull stacks
step read|Bathhouse slate|1|Read the slate on the old bathhouse in the west
step open|Family van's crate|1|Open the crate in the family's van in the north-west
step reach|rk_deep|1|Dive to the bathhouse cellar off the south shore
step collect|story:rk_deep|1|Open its strongbox with a ration tin and take what the Authority kept there
step reach|rk_trail|1|Find the foot of the trail up Chimney Tor, in the east
step reach|rk_summit|1|Climb the trail to the top of Chimney Tor
step collect|story:rk_top|1|Climb the great chimney and take Ines's hidden page from its deck box
step read|Rookery elders' plan|1|Read the elders' plan in their hut
step blueprint|Blueprint_ZiplineToolElectric|1|Take the electric zipline tool's plans from the elders' chest
step read|Storm warning|1|Read the storm warning
step reach|jump_rs_top|1|Hop up the egg-collectors' slabs on the south-west shore and watch the storm come in
quest done=The councils meet on the Crown tonight, in the storm. Bridgeworks Crown - band 1000.
quest reward=Leather*2;TitaniumOre*1

